          "type": "guided-reading",
          "theme": "body_health",
          "text": "We are learning how our bodies feel and move. My arm is strong. The ear is small. My eye sees a bird. This pig is short and fat. I am fine, thank you. It is hot in summer. My leg kicks the ball. After reading, we choose two new words and make our own sentences.",
