        {
          "id": "l1-u04-p2",
          "title": "People and Family: Second Reading",
          "type": "guided-reading",
          "theme": "people_family",
          "text": "My family and friends are together today. My neck feels fine. The man is waiting for the bus. I say hello to Mr. Wang. Mrs. Chen has a small store. Please ask Ms. Lin for help. My name is Tina. After reading, we choose two new words and make our own sentences.",
