          "type": "guided-reading",
          "theme": "animals_nature",
          "text": "We look around and notice animals and nature. I can see a kite in the sky. The sun is bright and warm. We planted a small tree by the house. My nose smells soup. The sad boy sits alone. I made a card for Grandma. After reading, we choose two new words and make our own sentences.",
