          "type": "guided-reading",
          "theme": "food",
          "text": "Our family is getting food ready for a meal. Please give me a cup of water. I cook an egg for lunch. We need food and water. We have rice and vegetables for lunch. Milk is in my cup. The pie is on the table. I drink warm tea in the morning. After reading, we choose two new words and make our own sentences.",
